<p style="text-align: left;"><a title="Link to Society, Culture &amp; Education Meta Major" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/academics/metamajors/meta_society.php"><img style="float: right;" src="https://www.ltcc.edu/_resources/images/ltcc_images/academics/metamajor_icons/society-culture-education-white-back.jpg" alt="Society Meta Major Icon" width="194" height="206" /></a></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The&nbsp;Psychology program at Lake Tahoe Community College provides students with general background knowledge in the field of psychology. In addition, students will gain a broader understanding of human behavior from various theoretical perspectives.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
